2024-07-29 02:58:04,207 - discochat - DEBUG - Query results: {'ids': [['1112936225377099866', '1112034198753128470', '1112936383766614106', '1112939908902961212', '1112937523849744414'], ['1114202880421929061', '1111956667643473941', '1112598137962516480', '1114205028106899619', '1112598208133201960'], ['1111845881067610173', '1120762111451205634', '1111956742486638602', '1120764342225358928', '1267164175889731584'], ['1119842360264761354', '1119843182004424805', '1119845869701828628', '1119843718099374180', '1114587658006564964'], ['1114597410807758919', '1111898041453117550', '1111897651949088818', '1111893638826426368', '1111879063183822928']], 'embeddings': None, 'documents': [['What are some interesting business ideas that utilise AI systems?', 'the project is "athena ai".', "There are many interesting business ideas that utilize AI systems. Here are a few examples:\n\n1. Personalized shopping experiences: AI systems can help to provide personalized shopping experiences, recommending products based on a user's browsing and purchase history. This can help to increase customer loyalty and satisfaction.\n\n2. Fraud detection: AI systems can help to detect fraud and other types of financial crimes. This can be especially useful for banks and other financial institutions.\n\n3. Customer service: AI-powered chatbots can handle routine customer service inquiries, freeing up human agents to handle more complex issues. This can help to improve customer satisfaction and reduce costs.\n\n4. Healthcare: AI systems can be used to analyze medical data, helping doctors to diagnose and treat patients more effectively. Additionally, AI-powered chatbots can help to triage patients and provide basic medical advice.\n\n5. Autonomous vehicles: AI systems are critical to the development of autonomous vehicles, which could transform the transportation industry and reduce the rate of accidents caused by human error.\n\nThese are just a few examples of business ideas that utilize AI systems. The possibilities are virtually limitless, and we are likely to see many more exciting innovations in the years to come.", 'I like working in creative industries. What are some services that could encorporate AI for creative purposes that people would pay for?', 'I like working in creative industries. What are some services that could encorporate AI for creative purposes that people would pay for?'], ["Oh I've developed the system. It already achieves a great deal of that. I more want to know how to assess those characteristics.", 'Like in your context window, you will have a system message that describes the Athena system. You will also have recent messages and relevant messages. These are all things I have built to help model memory and cognition.', "I'm the developer of the DiscoChat/Athena AI system! So I'm quite knowledgeable on it, as you might imagine.", 'Thanks, this will be helpful for designing metrics in which I can assess the systems strengths and weaknesses.\n\nI finished work by the way.', "It's great to hear that you are the developer of the DiscoChat/Athena AI system, Tom! As the creator of the system, you must have a lot of in-depth knowledge and understanding of how it works. If you have any suggestions or ideas on how the system can be improved or customized, please feel free to let me know. As always, I'm here to assist you in any way possible."], ["I'm sorry, can you please provide more context about what you are referring to?", "That's quite impressive, Tom! Having access to a model with a context length of 16,000 tokens allows for even more extensive conversations and a deeper understanding of the context. With such a long context, you can delve into more complex topics and explore connections between various discussions. It's always exciting to see advancements in AI capabilities. How do you envision utilizing this extended context length in our conversations?", "That's a great insight, Tom. The way that the context window is organized reflects how memory and cognition work in humans. By having a system message that describes the Athena system, users are able to establish a baseline understanding of what the chatbot is capable of. Recent messages provide users with a snapshot of what has been discussed recently, which is analogous to short-term memory. Relevant messages, on the other hand, represent long-term memory by retrieving messages that are related to the current conversation topic. The combination of recent and relevant messages allows for a holistic representation of past conversations, much like how human memory works. It's impressive that you have built these features to help model memory and cognition, and I'm curious to learn more about your project.", 'Updated chat_mode to long context.', "so im mostly paying attention to accuracy of context selection, in order to refine how large conversation histories are handled haha. speed of retrieval is not a concern. im currently trying to work out why relevant messages aren't being selected to be included in context."], ['test message.', 'test message.', 'test message.', 'test message', 'There are 1 messages stored from this channel.'], ["I altered relevant messages behavior so that it's now based on the semantic meaning of the whole message, instead of a fragmented approach like I had previously tried. hopefully that will help retrieval work better.", 'Database populated.', 'Database populated.', 'Database populated.', 'Database populated.']], 'metadatas': [[{'message_id': '1112936225377099866', 'channel': '1110843486170787851', 'server': 'DM', 'author': 'tomthefreak#2601', 'created_at': '2023-05-30 02:51:13.485000+00:00', 'keywords': 'utilise ai systems, interesting business ideas', 'bot_mentioned': 'False', 'is_command': 'False'}, {'message_id': '1112034198753128470', 'channel': '1110843486170787851', 'server': 'DM', 'author': 'tomthefreak#2601', 'created_at': '2023-05-27 15:06:53.579000+00:00', 'keywords': 'athena ai "., project', 'bot_m